只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"微信公众号内容生产工作台：防低创作度结构轮换写作法 + 视觉基线 + gpt-image 配图管线 + OCR 验收 + 小绿书草稿接口实测 (DeepSeek Harness plugin)","id":"gh:1335752156","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-wechat-mp-studio","slug":"FuncWei/dsh-wechat-mp-studio","topics":["content-creation","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","wechat","xiaolvshu"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"微信公众号内容生产工作台：防低创作度结构轮换写作法 + 视觉基线 + gpt-image 配图管线 + OCR 验收 + 小绿书草稿接口实测 (DeepSeek Harness plugin)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-wechat-mp-studio"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> WeChat Official Account content studio for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The first open-source plugin to package the **anti-“low creativity” playbook** for WeChat Official A"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ccount (公众号) content production — distilled from a real account that got flagged by the platform, we"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"nt through remediation, and recovered. Not theory."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Recurring-content accounts (morning greetings, goodnight wishes, solar-term cards, homilies, blessin"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"g cards…) rarely fail because they “write badly”. They fail because the platform flags them as **low"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" creativity** and turns off public recommendation. The platform scores a combination of signals — ca"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"tegory × format × frequency × fixed phrases:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- The same greeting text on every image, the same title prefix, the same hashtags, day after day;\n- "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"Multiple near-duplicate posts per day cannibalizing each other;\n- Templated structure: five posts wi"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"th the same skeleton = low-creativity signal."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This plugin provides an executable **anti-homogenization production pipeline**: structure-signature "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"rotation, the “daily delta” test, a visual baseline for blessing images, OCR acceptance for on-image"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" text, interaction rules, and draft-box sync — including measured parameters for the xiaolvshu (news"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"pic) internal web API."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## What's inside"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Capability | Details |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Rotation writing method | Six-variable structure signatures, anti-recency selection, six anti-homo"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"genization self-checks, anti-AI-slop language rules |\n| Daily delta test | Delete test / replace tes"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"t, seven rotating “conversation starter” sources |\n| Low-creativity remediation | Root-cause analysi"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s, remediation direction, recovery cadence, filter rules for common advice (de-identified) |\n| Visua"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"l baseline | Quantified “festive at a glance, clear on second look, credible on third” standard + 8 "},{"id":"p12s6","text":"acceptance checks |\n| Image pipeline | Native 2.35:1 cover prompt template, anti-typo rules for on-i"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"mage Chinese text, OCR acceptance SOP, troubleshooting |\n| Interaction guide | One primary call-to-a"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"ction (+ at most one secondary), fixed comment prompts, red lines, closing three-part formula |\n| Pu"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"blishing | Measured xiaolvshu (newspic) draft web API: upload `scene=5`, full `operate_appmsg type=7"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"7` form + format switches |\n| Scripts | `generate_images.py` (templated image generation), `ocr_veri"},{"id":"p12s11","text":"fy.py` (macOS Vision / MiniMax M3 dual backends) |\n| Log templates | Structure log and image log tem"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"plates (the rotation ledger) |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"After install, the model loads the `wechat-mp-studio` skill on demand (when writing MP content, gene"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rating images, syncing drafts, or debugging low-creativity flags). You can also invoke it explicitly"},{"id":"p15s3","text":": “use wechat-mp-studio to draft today's post”."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. **Write**: tell the model your account positioning (audience / persona / monetization) and let th"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e pipeline produce copy + a structure signature.\n2. **Generate images**: `python3 skills/wechat-mp-s"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"tudio/scripts/generate_images.py cover --text \"<today's blessing>\" --anchor \"<subject>\"` (set `IMAGE"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"_API_KEY` to a gpt-image-compatible endpoint).\n3. **Verify**: `python3 skills/wechat-mp-studio/scrip"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ts/ocr_verify.py --image cover.png --expected \"<today's blessing>\"`.\n4. **Sync draft**: follow `refe"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"rences/xiaolvshu-web-api.md` to push to the draft box (drafts only — publishing stays human-confirme"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"d).\n5. **Log**: append one row each to the structure log and image log; the next post reads them for"},{"id":"p17s8","text":" anti-recency selection."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Disclaimer"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- The WeChat MP web APIs (`operate_appmsg`, etc.) are internal, undocumented, and subject to change "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"at any time. The parameters here are a point-in-time measurement; re-verify per §4 of `references/xi"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"aolvshu-web-api.md` before use.\n- This plugin ships methodology and tooling, not guaranteed traffic."},{"id":"p21s4","text":" Follow platform rules and local regulations.\n- Third-party services (gpt-image, MiniMax, OpenCode G"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"o) used by the scripts require your own keys/quota."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
